Package: pi-status-agent
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: Amitosh Swain Mahapatra <amitosh.swain@gmail.com>
Depends: systemd
Description: Pi Status Display Agent
 Collects system metrics and streams them over USB CDC to an ESP32-S3
 status display. Also listens on a Unix socket for the desktop emulator.
